{"slug":"East_Asia","title":"East Asia","section":"Maps","cats":[],"headings":[{"id":"Map_nations","text":"Nations","level":2},{"id":"Map_data","text":"Map data","level":2},{"id":"See_also","text":"See also","level":1}],"html":"<div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">Not to be confused with <a href=\"/Asia\" title=\"Asia\">Asia</a>.</div>\n<p>On 18th of July the map <a href=\"/East_Asia\">Japan and Neighbors</a> had it’s name changed to East Asia in update 24.0. <sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></p>\n<p>It is claimed that its size is 1562 x 1646.<sup id=\"cite_ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></p>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><img src=\"/images/300px-Japan_height_map.webp.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"316\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"390\" data-file-height=\"411\"><figcaption><a href=\"/Height_Map\" title=\"Height Map\">Height map</a></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <a href=\"/Maps\">map</a> is focused around East Asia, and it contains the islands around Japan. Including a Russian one.</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<caption>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Countries present\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>China\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Russia\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>South Korea\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>North Korea\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><img src=\"/images/East_Asia_map.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"674\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"1562\" data-file-height=\"1646\"><figcaption>The East Asia map, from the <a href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/tree/main/map-generator/assets/maps/eastasia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenFront game files</a>.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2 id=\"Map_nations\">Nations</h2>\n<p>The map features 22 named <a href=\"/Nations\">nations</a>, including Hokkaido, Tohoku, Chubu, Kanto, Sakhalin and Chugoku.</p>\n<h2 id=\"Map_data\">Map data</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Categories:</strong> Asia</li>\n<li><strong>Nations:</strong> 22</li>\n<li><strong>Public rotation frequency:</strong> 5</li>\n</ul>\n<h1 id=\"See_also\">See also</h1>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/Maps\">Maps</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Asia\">Asia</a></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\" aria-label=\"Jump up\" title=\"Jump up\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1284581928254701718/1382406192655241359/1392632551205507162\" target=\"_blank\">https://discord.com/channels/1284581928254701718/1382406192655241359/1392632551205507162</a></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\" aria-label=\"Jump up\" title=\"Jump up\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1284581928254701718/1380587510153084958/1380686695518965830\" target=\"_blank\">https://discord.com/channels/1284581928254701718/1380587510153084958/1380686695518965830</a></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>"}
